join Barb center
Lizzy: BARB!
Barb: What..?
Lizzy: ALSO ONE MORE THING
label Journal Select
do MenuManager.open_journal()
[wait_input]
if {is_success} == true:
	do MinegameTest.update_background("strikes_number")
	if {current_item} == "b_clown_school":
		Lizzy: Success!
		Barb: I see
	elif {current_item} == "sewing_kit":
		Lizzy: Succes more specific for this one
		Barb: how did you know that??
	elif {current_item} == "b_camp_story":
		Lizzy: You got lost in the woods for three days at Little Oaks Summer Camp when you were six.
		Barb: What-
		Barb: How did you know that?
		Lizzy: You told me yourself.
		Lizzy: It was a very touching moment.
		Barb: Why would I ever tell you that?
		Lizzy: I was going to go do something dangerous and you advised me against it.
		Lizzy: You ate a pinecone and a poisonous bug.
	set {strikes_number} += 1.0
else:
	Barb: that's doesn't make sense
set {is_success} = false
if {strikes_number} < 3.0:
	jump Journal Select
[background fade="0.0"]
Barb: You make a good point.